  B2, B2_at_int, B2_of_Icc_int, B2poly, B2_of_B2poly, abs_B2_le, aestronglyMeasurable_B2, intervalIntegrable_B2_mul_deriv2, int_B1f'_period.':
If an authors line spans multiple lines, each line but the last must end with a trailing comma


