    ∫_j^{j+1} B̂₁·f′ = (1/12)(f′(j+1) − f′(j)) − (1/2)·∫_j^{j+1} B̂₂·f″,
from which the finite target follows by summation (atom-2b, next):

    ∑ k ∈ Ioc n m, f k = ∫_n^m f + ½(f m − f n)
                    + (1/12)(f′ m − f′ n) − ½·∫_n^m B̂₂·f″ dx.

